THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS / 제3자 구성 요소

The MIT licence above covers the KSubMaker source code in this repository only.

KSubMaker is distributed with, and downloads at runtime, third-party components
that are covered by their own licences. Two of them impose obligations that
matter to every user:

  * FFmpeg is shipped as an LGPL-2.1-or-later *shared* build and is invoked as a
    separate process. Replacing it with a GPL build changes the distribution
    terms of the whole package.

  * NLLB-200, the default translation model, is licensed under
    CC-BY-NC-4.0 — non-commercial use only. It is not bundled; the user
    downloads it explicitly.

위 MIT 라이선스는 이 저장소의 KSubMaker 소스 코드에만 적용됩니다.
함께 배포되거나 실행 중에 내려받는 제3자 구성 요소의 전체 목록, 각각의 라이선스,
그리고 지켜야 할 의무는 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md 를 참조하세요.

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the complete list of third-party components,
their licences and the obligations they carry.
